, {"id": 132016, "title": {"romaji": "Koisuru Shirokuma: Tokubetsu-ban", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "A seal attempts to escape a sleeping Polar Bear, fearing that Polar Bear will eat him. But before Seal can get far, Polar Bear wakes up and runs to him. Seal pleads to Polar Bear not to eat him, but Polar Bear instead performs a kabedon on Seal with a nearby ice wall.<br><br>\nThe original manga revolves around a polar bear who falls in love with an earless seal, and he wants nothing else except to protect him, even though the seal constantly thinks the bear will eat him.<br><br>(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 2}, "season": "SPRING", "seasonYear": 2017, "episodes": 3, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "Shoujo", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Animals", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Boys' Love", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Snowscape", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 132515, "title": {"romaji": "Annyeong Jaduya 4: Jaduwa Chingudeul", "english": null}, "format": "TV_SHORT", "description": "<i>Note: The first 3 episodes that broadcasted in season 4 are the 2017 movie cut into parts.</i>", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 5}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 24, "duration": 12, "countryOfOrigin": "KR", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 132816, "title": {"romaji": "Unbelievable Space Love", "english": "Unbelievable Space Love"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Gazing at the scenic view of the sky, a man is joined by a stranger who informs him that he is in a dream. Unable to recall the memories of his life, he relies on the visitor to take him on a journey of discovery. Revealing everything—from their seven-year relationship to the emotional hardships they faced together—the two rekindle their bond severed by time. Behind this beautiful love story, however, lies a much darker truth.\n<br><br>\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 8}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 10, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "KR", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Romance", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Boys' Love", "rank": 86, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "LGBTQ+ Themes", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Space", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Artificial Intelligence", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 135278, "title": {"romaji": "Chao Zhineng Zuqiu 2: Shijie Dasai Pian", "english": null}, "format": "TV", "description": "The second season of <i>Chao Zhineng Zuqiu</i>", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 6}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 52, "duration": 25, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Sci-Fi", "Sports"], "tags": [{"name": "Football", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 136164, "title": {"romaji": "Xian Hun Hou Chong Xiao Jiao Qi", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 6}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 9}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 23, "duration": null, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Romance"], "tags": []}, {"id": 136222, "title": {"romaji": "Musunde Hiraite", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Named after a Japanese children's song meaning \"Closed Hands, Open Hands\", Musunde Hiraite is an ensemble story that primarily follows Hiroshi Furuya, a high school student who falls head over heals for Himari Asaki, a beautiful high school senior, on the day of his high school entrance. Although Hiroshi constantly tries to confess his feelings, Himari studiously avoids him, because she's secretly afraid of men.<br><br>(Source: Crunchyroll)", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 9}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 11}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 30, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Ecchi", "Romance", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "School", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Vertical Video", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 136783, "title": {"romaji": "sparkle", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video by Tarafu Ootani for the song sparkle by Japanese electronic artist Serph from his album \"Aerialist.\"", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 4}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 137535, "title": {"romaji": "SEX: prologue", "english": null}, "format": "OVA", "description": "Despite the title this OVA has nothing to do with sex, just young people rebelling against the world.<br>\n<br>\nThe promotional video is a home video exclusive titled <i>SEX ~prologue~</i> directed by Sayo Yamamoto and animated by studio MAPPA. The anime depicts an original story before the manga where Kaho arrives, and when Yuki and Natsu have just met in Okinawa. <br>\n<br>\nTo receive the PV, customers must first purchase all four volumes of the Sex 30th Anniversary Edition manga volumes, take the tickets included in volumes 1-3 and send them with the postcard included with volume 4. The Blu-ray Disc will be sent to buyers in March 2018 so long as the postcard is postmarked before December 31.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Anime News Network, edited)\n<br><br>\n<i> Note: Had pre-screenings during March 8 to 14th, 2018 at the Liberty Gallery's Atsushi Kamijo solo exhibition. </i>", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 3}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": "#完全版SEX", "genres": ["Action"], "tags": [{"name": "Seinen", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 138257, "title": {"romaji": "\"Calpis\" Hakkou Monogatari", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "A Calpis (Calpico in the US) commissioned short about the history of the company and how their product is made today. A few scenes use live-action footage. The short is animated by Takaharu Shimizu who used a Rube Goldberg style of story telling.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 4}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Advertisement", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 138961, "title": {"romaji": "CHAINSAW BUNNY: Deleted Scene", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "A \"deleted scene\" from Chainsaw Bunny, where the monster becomes a giant pink faceless looming creature.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 8}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 1, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Horror", "Supernatural", "Thriller"], "tags": [{"name": "Stop Motion", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 138966, "title": {"romaji": "Matsuda-ke Curry Battle", "english": null}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "A video created for the Matsuda family wedding ceremony in October by Inoue Ryou. In it the wedding couple battles out whose curry is better but in the end, both taste great according to the couple's baby.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 10}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Music"], "tags": []}, {"id": 138976, "title": {"romaji": "Hako no Naka no Tenshi", "english": "Angel inside a box"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "This video installation is an experiment that imagines the canvas as a box and animates images within that space.\n<br><br>\n1st year work 2018, Tokyo University of the Arts, Graduate School of Film and New Media, Department of Animation\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)\n", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological"], "tags": [{"name": "Achromatic", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 138994, "title": {"romaji": "usa Weather Show", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Usa has a weather show with a guest slug who is excited that it will finally be raining.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 6}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 6}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": []}, {"id": 139109, "title": {"romaji": "Echo: Kodama Suru Uta", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "A young boy is moving away, he has a tearful farewell with his friends. Their words of encouragement and love echo against the ocean waves and in his heart.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 2}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 2}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 139248, "title": {"romaji": "Shinju Kusa", "english": "The Pearl Remains"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "A woman traces her memories through a pearl ring, and comes upon her mother gazing at the same ring. But her memories soon lose their outline and become enclosed within the pearl.\n<br><br>\n1st year work 2018, Tokyo University of the Arts, Graduate School of Film and New Media, Department of Animation\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 1}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological"], "tags": [{"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 139695, "title": {"romaji": "Lion Nani no Tabi", "english": "Lion Nanny’s Journey"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Lion Nanny rides the train and embarks on a life journey while interacting with those around her.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Graduate Work 2018, Tokyo University of the Arts, Graduate School of Film and New Media, Department of Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 7, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure", "Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 139728, "title": {"romaji": "Congming De Shunliu 2", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The second season of <i>Congming De Shunliu 2</i>.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 7}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 52, "duration": 13, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action"], "tags": [{"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Military", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 140035, "title": {"romaji": "Mofumofuiction", "english": "Fluffiction"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Fluffy turtles, fluffy monkeys, fluffy lizards. Discover the world populated by these mysteriously charming imaginary creatures. They ha